## Output Format

Generate a markdown document with the following sections. Use concise, actionable language. Avoid redundant information already present in README.

```markdown
# {{ project_name }}

## Overview
Brief project description (2-3 sentences).

## Technology Stack
- Languages:
- Frameworks:
- Runtime:
- Package Manager:

## Project Structure
Key directories and their purposes.

## Development Setup
### Prerequisites
List required tools/services (Node.js, Python, Docker, etc.)

### Installation
Step-by-step commands to install dependencies.

### Running Locally
Commands to start the project in development mode.

## Conventions & Guidelines
- Coding style
- Naming conventions
- Branch strategy
- Commit message format

## Infrastructure Dependencies
- Services required (DB, Redis, Message Queue, etc.)
- Port assignments
- Docker Compose services (if applicable)

## Environment Variables
